BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Friends of the Poor Walk/Run
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T113000
UID:2609195aT3T5F8hU-VbTJENxlZBQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 2026 St. Vincent de Paul Friends of the Poor W
 alk/Run and help support families in Vallejo!\n\nGet ready to lace up your
  sneakers for a 3 mile walk and support a great cause. This in-person even
 t is all about helping Vallejo families in need. Bring your friends\, enjo
 y the snacks\, soak up the live ukulele band\, and make a real difference 
 in the community. Please consider donating!\n\nSt. Vincent de Paul Society
  has been around since 1833 and the Vallejo nonprofit has been consistentl
 y serving our community since the 1980s. The Friends of the Poor walk is a
  nationwide fundraiser for St. Vincent de Paul since 2008. The St. Vincent
  de Paul Society Conferences of St. Vincent Ferrer and St. Catherine of Si
 ena are walking together to fundraise for our friends in need in Vallejo.\
 n\nAreas of work for SVDP St. Vincent Ferrer include:\n\n Food\n\n P
 G&E and water bills\n\n Rental assistance\n\n Providing furniture an
 d appliances for homeless neighbors moving to transitional housing\n\n 
 Monthly meal service at the Dream Center and Baptist Church\n\n Food dr
 ives to support our pantry\n\n Dinner packages for Thanksgiving\, Chris
 tmas\, and more\n\nSVdP is a registered 501\\(c\\)\\(3\\) nonprofit organi
 zation. 100% of money raise go directly to serve those in need. Registrati
 on is free but with a donation of $10 you can receive a FOP Walk t-shirt.
LOCATION:Vallejo Waterfront
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/2026-svdp-fundraiser-friends-of-the-poor-
 walkrun-tickets-1995614301095?aff=oddtdtcreator&referrer=https%3A%2F%2F202
 6svdpvallejofopwalk.eventbrite.com%2F
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
