DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T160000
UID:260922qDyTxvD8Y0Khd8DyCoEpJg
DESCRIPTION:Grab the whole family and join us for an afternoon of Oktoberf
 est fun under the redwoods!\n\nWe’re excited to welcome Sarah Gronquist\
 , a wonderfully versatile Bay Area musician bringing accordion\, vocals an
 d plenty of personality to the Roadhouse. With a musical background spanni
 ng swing\, tango\, gypsy jazz and accordion traditions\, Sarah is the perf
 ect soundtrack for an Oktoberfest celebration!\n\nAnd this one is for ALL 
 AGES! Bring the kids\, bring the grandparents and come ready to play.\n\n
 🥨 Oktoberfest food specials 🍺 German beers & festive pours 🪗 Live
  accordion music with Sarah Gronquist 🏆 Family-friendly games\, contest
 s & prizes 🎯 Fun for the kids AND grown-ups\n\nCome hungry\, grab a ste
 in\, get in on the games and make an afternoon of it.\n\nPROST! 🍻🥨\n
 \nFREE TO ATTEND
LOCATION:Rio Nido Roadhouse
URL:https://www.rionidoroadhouse.com/calendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
