DESCRIPTION:Transform Your Memories into Meaningful Narrative\n\nA Writing
  Retreat in Beautiful West County\n\nReady to tell your story? Your memori
 es are waiting to become literature. Discover the power of your personal s
 tory and learn to craft it with authenticity\, depth\, and literary grace.
 \n\nWorkshop Overview\n\nJoin us for an immersive memoir writing experienc
 e designed to help you uncover\, shape\, and share the stories that have d
 efined your life. Whether you're a complete beginner or have been writing 
 for years\, this workshop will provide you with the tools and confidence t
 o transform your memories into compelling prose.\n\nWhat You will Learn:\n
 \nMemory Mining Techniques\n\nNarrative Structure\n\nVoice & Perspective\n
 \nScene Construction\n\nTruth vs. Accuracy\n\nCharacter Development\n\nRev
 ision Strategies\n\nDetails\n\nWorkshop fee is $147\, $127 for OCA members
 . Limited to 8 participants. Held in the OCA Studio.\n\nLed By\n\nAlaura O
 ’Dell (MFA)\, an experienced memoir author and writing instructor.
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts
URL:https://eventvesta.com/events/163611/t/tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
