 ecide who rises to the top.\n\n💰 **Winner Gets $500**\n\nOne performer
  will leave the stage with bigger pockets and a feature in upcoming Mercy 
 Wellness email marketing.\n\n🌿 **An Elevated Night Out**\n\nEnjoy the 
 show inside The Lounge at Mercy with good people\, great entertainment\, a
 nd even better smoke.\n\n**Tickets**\n\n**🐦 Early Bird General Admissio
 n — Available Through September 4**\n\nLock in early bird pricing for ge
 neral admission before it’s gone.\n\n**🎟 General Admission**\n\nEntry
  to **Highly Talented** with access to the full talent show from 6–10 
 PM.\n\nSeating is subject to availability\, so arrive early\, get comforta
 ble\, and settle in before the performances begin.\n\n**Think You’re Hig
 hly Talented?**\n\nWe’re still looking for performers to take the stage.
 \n\n**Audition sign-ups close September 18.**\n\nContestants who sign up r
 eceive:\n\n✨ A goodie bag\n\n🎟 One additional General Admission ticke
 t for a guest\n\n💰 The opportunity to get **$500**\n\n📧 A feature i
 n upcoming Mercy Wellness email marketing if selected as the winner\n\nAud
