DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T193000
UID:260909p48MXRkRVkKo2kFC5_qQJg
DESCRIPTION:Renegade Orchestra - The Beauty of a Symphony\, the Soul of a 
 Rock Band\n\nThe Renegade Orchestra is the bay area’s most rock and roll
  symphony. Is it a rock band? Is it an orchestra? Who knows? But it’s de
 finitely the best of both worlds. The pure unbridled fury of some of the b
 ay area’s top orchestra players unleashed on classic rock songs backed u
 p by a hard-hitting rhythm section.\n\nFor their 2026 - 2027 season\, the 
 opening concert will be on Sept 26 at 7:30 pm at the beautiful Sebastiani 
 Theater on the plaza in downtown Sonoma. The Renegade Orchestra will rock 
 out to classic songs from Hendrix to Metallica and from Bowie to Zeppelin.
 \n\nAt this show\, the Renegade Orchestra will present a comfortable\, but
  lively show featuring around top bay area string players combined with a 
 driving rhythm section\, all committed to having a relaxed and rocking tim
 e. If there is something you hate about orchestra concerts\, this is the o
 pposite.\n\n“Classical Rebels.” The Bohemian\n\n“The Renegade Orches
 tra would rather tackle Hendrix than Handel.” Mercury News\n\nRenegade O
 rchestra at the Sebastiani Theater\n\n476 1st St E\, Sonoma\, CA 95476\n\n
 Sept 26 at 7:30 pm\n\nTickets: $30 at RenegadeOrchestra.com
LOCATION:Sebastiani Theatre
URL:https://www.sebastianitheatre.org/calendar/2026/7/15/renegade-orchestr
 a
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
