DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T170000
UID:260804cnvbn4v7-0-gDDK4x_bqlQ
DESCRIPTION:**Transform Your Memories into Meaningful Narrative** A Writin
 g Retreat in Beautiful West County\n\nReady to tell your story? Your memor
 ies are waiting to become literature. Discover the power of your personal 
 story and learn to craft it with authenticity\, depth\, and literary grace
 .\n\n**Workshop Overview** Join us for an immersive memoir writing experie
 nce designed to help you uncover\, shape\, and share the stories that have
  defined your life. Whether you're a complete beginner or have been writin
 g for years\, this workshop will provide you with the tools and confidence
  to transform your memories into compelling prose.\n\n**What you will lear
 n**\n\nMemory mining techniques\n\nNarrative structure\n\nVoice & perspect
 ive\n\nScene construction\n\nTruth vs. accuracy\n\nCharacter development\n
 \nRevision strategies\n\n**Details** Fee: $147 ($127 for OCA members). Lim
 ited to 8 participants. Held in the OCA Studio.\n\n**Led by** Alaura O’D
 ell (MFA)\, memoir author and writing instructor.
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts
URL:https://eventvesta.com/events/156816/t/tickets
