 r purchase\, and we'll be pouring wine all evening. Get ready to jam wit
 h our good friends\, the Crosby Collective\, and opener Keystone Revisit
 ed. We're excited to be welcoming back local nonprofit\, SwimAmerica So
 noma\, for their annual fundraising auction.  \n\nTickets are $95 per pe
 rson and include two glasses of wine. Phil Sent Me members are $75 per per
 son and include wine for the night. Food and additional glasses of wine 
 and bottles are available for purchase.  \n\nParking is limited at the
  barn. Additional parking and complimentary shuttle rides are available 
 at the Tasting House.  \n\nChairs and blankets are encouraged\, but plea
 se be mindful not to bring anything with stakes that could damage the grou
 nd. We also recommend reusable glasses and water bottles\, sunscreen\, and
  your dancing shoes.  \n\nDenmark Street Barn is located at 1700 Denma
 rk Street\, Sonoma\, CA 95476.  \n\nAdditional parking and shuttle pick
 up/drop off is located at Winery Sixteen 600 Tasting House\, 589 First S
 t. W\, Sonoma\, CA 95476.  \n\nQuestions? Give us a call\, text\, or em
 ail. We can't wait to see you all there!
LOCATION:Denmark Street Barn
URL:https://www.winerysixteen600.com/product/detail/harvest-party-at-the-d
 enmark-barn---september27--2026/
