DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T220000
UID:260915IWbSvq539UaYkstkVi_o-g
DESCRIPTION:Bandjango Collectif is a wild-around-the-edges musical experie
 nce\, melding French Gypsy Jazz & Chanson\, New Orleans Jazz\, and global 
 traditional folk into one vibrant\, transportive sound. Bay Area Jazz voca
 list\, Stella Heath\, leads this spirited ensemble in performances that ar
 e at once deeply rooted and joyfully unpredictable. With a French-inspired
  global panoply of sounds\, Bandjango showcases Heath's magnetic vocals al
 ongside tight\, driving rhythms and playful improvisation with a rotating 
 cast of world-class musicians. The band's sound moves effortlessly between
  smoky Parisian cabarets\, New Orleans dance halls\, and far-reaching musi
 cal traditions-inviting audiences into a rich and celebratory musical land
 scape. Doors open 6:30 pm. BUY IN ADVANCE! TICKETS AT THE DOOR ZONE C ONLY
 .
