 e of nature. The times of day and the seasons bring with it different and 
 exciting color palettes. Location: La Crema Winery\, 3575 Slusser Rd\, Win
 dsor\, CA 95492 Time: Tuesday thru Sunday 10am - 5pm. Dates: Opens July 20
