 g in at Veterans Memorial Park\, you’ll stroll through Yountville\, visi
 ting participating wineries\, tasting rooms\, restaurants\, and local busi
 nesses while enjoying wine tastings\, festive décor\, seasonal surprises\
 , and exclusive event-day offerings. \n\n**Costumes are encouraged**\, so
