BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Symphonic Wind Ensemble & USAF Band of the Golden West
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T193000
UID:260925ArGjC0Kf30qI1ExU6PzdbQ
DESCRIPTION:Under the direction of Dr. Andy Collinsworth\, the Symphonic W
 ind Ensemble will perform John Williams’ iconic *Liberty Fanfare*\, *Twe
 nty-One*\, a musical tribute to baseball legend Roberto Clemente by compos
 er Giovanni Santos\, Aaron Copland’s *Old American Songs*\, featuring th
 e SSU Symphonic Chorus\, a beautiful arrangement of *Sweet Chariot* by Car
 los Simon\, and Frank Ticheli’s fiery jazz masterpiece\, *Blue Shades*. 
 The second half of the program features the USAF Band of the Golden West f
 rom Tavis AFB\, under the direction of Capt. Brian O’Donnell.
