UID:260914wLj0AVAZ0UiEm-UuAXdY1A
DESCRIPTION:Cuban Salsa Class with Eric Celestino & Abigail Celestino\n\n4
 week class\n\nOctober 1 – October 22\n\nClass requires a minimum of 8 re
 gistrations to run. Please register soon so we can secure the session!\n\n
 This is a beginner cuban salsa—you will learn your basic footwork and tu
 rns.\n\nIn this class\, you will learn the fundamentals of Cuban Salsa\, i
 ncluding body movement\, rhythm\, musicality\, footwork\, partner connecti
 on\, and partnerwork patterns inspired by authentic Cuban dance culture. W
 e focus on proper technique\, coordination\, flow\, and natural body expre
 ssion\, while also building confidence and strong foundations.\n\nClasses 
 are structured with:\n\n• Warm-up and body movement\n\n• Footwork and 
 rhythm exercises\n\n• Partnerwork technique\n\n• Short combinations an
 d practical applications\n\nOur goal is to help you understand how to danc
 e salsa\, not just memorize steps — developing timing\, connection\, and
  a comfortable\, joyful way of dancing.\n\nCome dance with us\, grow your 
 technique\, and experience the energy and flavor of Cuba in a supportive a
 nd welcoming environment.\n\nBook your spot\n\nDate & Time:\n\n4week class
 \, October 1 – October 22\n\nThursdays @ 7:30 PM\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwoo
 d Highway \\#8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor
  marking shoe soles allowed.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/cuban-salsa/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
