UID:260923UJ565HNjEEyMwaV9_AZTmQ
DESCRIPTION:The Pronzini Farms Pumpkin Patch in Petaluma offers acres of f
 un in the fall. Pick pumpkins\, play games\, visit farm animals\, tour the
  Haunted Village\, and more. Choose from a wide variety of pumpkins in the
 ir u-pick field. Enjoy BBQ from the Cowgirl Cafe\, and fresh popped kettle
  corn. It's run by the same Pronzini family that operates Christmas tree l
 ots in Marin during the holidays. Admission to the pumpkin patch: Weekend 
 Adult: $7 Ages 3-12\, $5 Ages 0-2 are free Weekday Adult $5 Ages 0-12 are 
 free
