BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Adrian West Band
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T160000
UID:260921jKOe2AYdEE-3KM5xFyybIA
DESCRIPTION:Come hear the five-piece Adrian West Band perform in the beerg
 arden at Waterhawk Lake Club in Rohnert Park! Free show\, all ages (tips a
 ppreciated). We play from 4 - 7pm.\n\nAdrian West Band is a five-piece aco
 ustic rock ensemble from Oakland. They play a fun mix of originals\, cover
 s and instrumentals plus a bit of jazz. Some have described their sound as
  “Paul Simon meets Talking Heads”.\n\nAdrian enjoys setting philosophi
 cal lyrics to joyful music. His topics may veer a tad dark at times but th
 e underlying music is uplifting\, giving the listener a richly layered exp
 erience. Whether he's telling a story about a skinny-dipping episode gone 
 awry or grappling with some major challenge facing humanity\, his lyrics a
 re infused with equal parts hope\, realism and whimsy.\n\nAdrian West - vo
 cals\, acoustic guitar\, elec. violin & live looping Larisa Roberts - voca
 ls\, percussion Chris Haag - alto sax JJ Hartmann - upright bass Nick Sage
 r - drums\n\nBand website: www.adrianwest.com\n\n\\------\n\nBrewsters Bee
 r Garden is located in the historic district of downtown Petaluma. We are 
 an open-air dining restaurant with over 350 seats.\n\nOur cuisine is focus
 ed on technique driven dishes influenced by Southern Carolina BBQ and a sm
 attering of locally sourced and sustainably raised Petaluma producers and 
 ranchers. Think southern BBQ meets California produce with a refined touch
  of explosive flavors.\n\nThe dining space compliments the food perfectly 
 as guests are treated to outdoor seating in a historic setting\, with the 
 comforts of large heat lamps\, fire pit and live music stage.\n\nWe offer 
 an array of over 30 revolving local craft beers on draft\, Sonoma and Napa
  Valley wine\, and a full selection of spirits and cocktails.\n\nBrewsters
  was built for people that want more than just a good meal when they eat\,
  they want a dining experience. We are laid back\, kid & dog friendly\, an
 d like to have fun.\n\nMore at www.brewstersbeergarden.com
LOCATION:Waterhawk Lake Club
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/adrian-west-band/199643
 52/2026-10-03T16
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
