DESCRIPTION:OCA is proud to present "Poets Meet Artists"\, a collaboration
  where artists and poets work together to create a mutual celebration of b
 oth media. Poets honor visual artists by writing a poem to interpret their
  art\, and artists created a piece of art to interpret a poem. Join us as 
 we celebrate this special connection between poetry and art at our recepti
 on on Saturday\, October 3rd where you'll enjoy selected readings by the p
 oets and the exhibit of paired works. Poets and Artists included in this e
 xhibit: Suze Cohan Marylu Downing Andrea van Dyke Sarah Dupre Patrick Fann
 ing Steve Fowler Elizabeth Herron Rich Levin Diane masura Jessica Morell S
 u Mcmurtry Lesley Pickford Elise Loveday Brown Darcy Reinier Oak Reinier D
