 t on your dancing shoes and join Stella & The Starlights for a night of li
 ve swing music and dancing at Hall of the Above in Petaluma!\n\nVocalist S
 tella Heath and the band bring the sounds of the swing era to life with mu
 sic made famous by Ella Fitzgerald\, Billie Holiday\, Louis Armstrong\, Co
 unt Basie\, Duke Ellington\, and more. The evening kicks off with a swing 
 dance lesson led by Jasmine Worrell\, followed by a high-energy night of c
 lassic swing\, hot jazz\, and plenty of room to dance.\n\nWhether you’re
