DESCRIPTION:Golden Hour in Good Company – October Locals Night\n\nWednes
 day\, October 7 | 5:30–8:00 PM\n\nCelebrate the golden beauty of autumn 
 with us at Osmosis Day Spa Sanctuary. Our October Locals Night is a specia
 l evening event dedicated to community\, relaxation\, and local flavor. \n
 \nYour evening experience includes delicious local bites\, cedar enzyme fo
 ot bath\, and your choice of a mini Pumpkin Enzyme Facial or a mini massag
 e. \n\nAs the sun sets and golden hour fills the gardens and spa\, savor A
 utumn treats – tastings of a unique Black Sesame Honey Butter\, seasonal
  beverages\, and wine provided from our neighbors at Black Kite Cellars. 
  \n\nPricing\n\n$59 – Cedar Enzyme Foot Bath Base Ticket\n\n$109 – Ced
 ar Enzyme Foot Bath \\+ Mini Pumpkin Enzyme Facial or Mini Massage Premium
  Ticket\n\nJoin us to unwind\, connect\, and embrace the magic of October 
 at Osmosis Day Spa Sanctuary. We can’t wait to welcome you for an unforg
 ettable evening of wellness\, community\, and autumn inspired spa experien
 ces.  \n\nJoin Us!
