UID:260925eMYNo1T81UOlyATeORVzCQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an incredible night of reggae music in Healdsburg 
 on Friday Oct 9th with one of Nor Cal's premiere reggae bands: Dubcraft!\n
 \nThe party will be kicking off at 8pm sharp! $15 at the door | 21\\+\n\nD
 UBCRAFT: Based out of Northern California\, Dubcraft does reggae their own
  way – delivering a unique blend of both vintage and modern sounds that 
 are specifically crafted to catch the listener’s ear. Influenced heavily
  by Jamaican and European-based “Rub-a-dub” music\, getting the crowd 
 engaged\, dancing\, and singing along is their primary goal. Incorporating
  hypnotizing dub sections\, catchy melodies\, and crowd participation\, Du
 bcraft puts on explosive live performances that always leave the crowd wan
 ting more. Currently performing as a 6-piece band\, they are guaranteed to
  deliver a high-energy\, heavy hitting performance every time they hit the
  stage.
LOCATION:Elephant In The Room
URL:https://www.elephantintheroompub.com/music-calendar.html
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
