BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:P.U.R.R. Presents: A Punk Clown Takeover — Mutual Aid Benefit
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T000000
UID:2609158fJS_VupDk6yRwGhEDyZ0A
DESCRIPTION:P.U.R.R. PRESENTS: A PUNK CLOWN TAKEOVER \n\nPunks United in 
 Real Resistance takes over Barrel Proof Lounge for six hours of live punk\
 , drag\, DJs\, DIY vendors\, clown chaos\, food and mutual aid — ALL AGE
 S.\n\nFriday\, October 9\, Barrel Proof gets taken over from 6 PM to midni
 ght for a benefit supporting Sonoma County Acts of Kindness.\n\nAt the cen
 ter of the bill are Menstrual Tramps\, the longtime DIY hardcore/street-pu
 nk band coming to Santa Rosa from Minneapolis. Formed in the late ’90s\,
  Menstrual Tramps have spent decades making fiercely independent punk\, wi
 th releases including Exploitation\, No Hesitation\, No Defeat and 2020's 
 Cutthroat EP.\n\nLIVE MUSIC\n\n Menstrual Tramps — Minneapolis  Fatale
   Damage Party  Hellbound Pound\n\nPlus DJ Armagidon spinning hardcore p
 unk vinyl.\n\nSPECIAL DRAG PERFORMANCE\n\n★ Titus Androgynous ★\n\nLOC
 AL DIY PUNK MARKET\n\nShop local artists\, makers\, vintage\, distro and p
 unk vendors throughout the night\, including:\n\nDark Hearts Vintage • N
 orthbay Pyrate Punx • Zombie Junkyard • Pussy Heaven Distro • bead W
 1zard\n\nPlus punk-clown face painting by Fire Goddess\, a memento mori ph
 oto booth\, and more.\n\nCome hungry — Tacos El Gran Mac will be serving
  food.\n\nPUNK WITH A PURPOSE\n\nThis isn't just a show.\n\nA Punk Clown T
 akeover is a mutual aid benefit for Sonoma County Acts of Kindness\, a vol
 unteer-run Sonoma County nonprofit providing basic necessities\, resources
  and advocacy for unhoused and financially underprivileged members of our 
 community.\n\nTheir volunteers distribute meals every day and provide nece
 ssities including hygiene supplies\, clothing\, tents\, tarps\, sleeping b
 ags and cold-weather gear directly to people who need them.\n\nLearn more 
 about Sonoma County Acts of Kindness\n\nEVENT DETAILS\n\n Friday\, Octobe
 r 9\, 2026  6 PM–Midnight  Barrel Proof Lounge — Downtown Santa Rosa
   $10–$50 Sliding Scale  Clown attire HIGHLY encouraged  Wheelchair a
 ccessible  ALL AGES\n\nCome dressed weird. Come loud. Bring your friends.
  Support touring and local punk\, local artists\, mutual aid and your Sono
 ma County neighbors.\n\nP.U.R.R. — Punks United in Real Resistance.\n\nC
 heck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://PunkClown.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
