BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Workshop: Off the Grid Printing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T150000
UID:260819lsaJwBQMYUO-wpirt_jhFA
DESCRIPTION:In this two day workshop\, students will work hands-on with me
 tal and wood type to create off-grid compositions-playing with spacing\, r
 otation\, fragmentation\, overlap\, and improvisation. We'll explore how i
 mbalance\, disruption\, and intuition can shape meaning\, rhythm\, and vis
 ual impact in printed work. This class emphasizes process over perfection.
  Expect to test ideas\, make quick prints\, respond to chance\, and let th
 e material qualities of type and press guide the work. Suitable for curiou
 s beginners and experienced printers alike\, this workshop offers a suppor
 tive space to experiment\, loosen habits\, and discover new possibilities 
 in letterpress printing beyond the grid. All materials provided. No prior 
 letterpress experience required\, though comfort with basic printing conce
 pts is helpful.
LOCATION:D
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/workshop-off-the-grid-printing/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
