BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Moms Supporting Moms: Single Mom & Default Parent Support Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T203000
UID:260803wLBNVf-FVUWGB7uivrN_vQ
DESCRIPTION:Single moms—and moms carrying most of the parenting load—a
 re invited to a cozy\, judgment-free evening at Shimmery Alchemy Studio in
  Santa Rosa.\n\nCome exactly as you are\, sip warm tea\, and connect with 
 women who understand the exhaustion\, overwhelm\, and isolation that can c
 ome with carrying the parenting load largely alone. We’ll have honest co
 nversations about default parenting\, solo parenting\, mom burnout\, and f
 inding genuine community.\n\nSweatpants and late arrivals are welcome. Spa
 ce is limited to keep the circle comfortable and intimate.\n\n**Thursday\,
