BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Salsa Beginners 2 - Mondays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T190000
UID:260427J7pOptO2zkeFie1mx6jwRQ
DESCRIPTION:Ready to take your salsa to the next level? Salsa lessons in M
 arin will help you to add some flair and fluidity to your salsa dancing.\n
 \nPre-requisite: Salsa Beginners 1 – You know your basic steps\, left tu
 rn\, right turn\, cross-body lead\, and you hold your frame.\n\nWhat You
 ’ll Learn\n\nWe’ve curated a curriculum designed to build your confide
 nce and your “social dance” vocabulary:\n\n• The Cross Body Lead \\(
 CBL\\) Series: Master both Inside and Outside Turns\, the essential buildi
 ng blocks for moving your partner across the floor with grace.\n\n• The 
 “I Turn – You Turn”: A classic social dance staple that develops tim
 ing and hand-change coordination.\n\n• The Walk-Through: Learn how to tr
 ansition smoothly through the dance space without breaking your rhythm.\n\
 n• Footwork & Shine: We’ll break down the footwork pattern that adds p
 ersonality to your “shines.”\n\nTechnique & Artistry\n\n• Dancing is
  about more than just where your feet go. In this level\, we dive deeper i
 nto the “how”:\n\n• The Frame: Understand the “tension and compres
 sion” needed to lead and follow clearly without using muscle.\n\n• Upp
 er Body Mechanics: Learn how to isolate your ribcage and shoulders to move
  with that authentic Latin soul.\n\n• Connection: Developing a “heavy
 ” but responsive arm connection to ensure your partner feels every lead.
 \n\nImportant Details\n\n• No dance experience required: Whether you’v
 e never danced before or it’s been a while\, you’re welcome here!\n\n
 • No partner necessary: Come solo or bring a friend—either way\, you
 ’ll have plenty of opportunities to dance.\n\n• Please wear non-markin
 g shoe soles: This helps us keep our dance floor in great condition.\n\nDa
 te & Time:\n\nMonday 6:00 PM\n\nSaturday 11:00 AM\n\nInstructor: Lucie Ebn
 erova\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8 San Rafael\, CA \\(salsa lesso
 ns in Marin\\)\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking shoe so
 les allowed.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-beginners-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Move N Groove
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T170000
UID:2603191Pq-Awocd0e7EtD8BAM4sg
DESCRIPTION:Find Your Rhythm with James Darling Looking for a fun way to 
 stay active? Join James for a fun dance session designed for everyone. We
 ’re turning up the volume on the world’s biggest pop hits—come expre
 ss yourself and leave it all on the floor!\n\nNo stress: Every song uses 
 repetitive moves so you’ll be a pro by the final chorus.\n\nGet confiden
 t: We rotate the same playlist all month long\, giving you plenty of time
  to master the groove.\n\nJoin the party!\n\nAt Move N Groove\, we care m
 ore about your smile than your footwork. This isn’t just a cardio dance 
 class\; it’s a high-energy trip through musical theater\, world beats\, 
 and your favorite hits from every decade.\n\nCome sweat\, laugh\, and danc
 e like nobody’s watching.\n\nAbout James\n\nPutting the fun in fitness f
 or over 30 years!\n\nI’ve been teaching and developing challenging class
 es that put the joy in enjoyment. Our bodies need to keep moving to mainta
 in balance\, strength\, flexibility\, and so much more. Why not make it fu
 n?\n\nThe more we move the better we feel. It’s proven that the only way
  to keep your body in tip top shape is to keep going. So why not have a fa
 bulous time while doing it? Come to class and see how your thoughts on mov
 ement will shift towards a happier more fulfilled experience at the gym.\n
 \nDATE AND TIME: Mondays\, 4:00 PM
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/classes/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
