 mar Thomas’ jazz infused Forward/Still\, Ira Hearshen’s arrangement of
  *Symphonic Dances from Fiddler on the Roof*\, and John Philip Sousa’s s
 oaring march *The Invincible Eagle*. Join us for an unforgettable evening 
