UID:260918TmhvexjJyEyiVHTjTEkZkA
DESCRIPTION:BLS Certification Class \\(AHA\\) - In Person\, Instructor-Led
 \n\nAmerican Heart Association BLS certification class \\(in-person\, inst
 ructor-led class in our Rohnert Park classroom\\). BLS \\(Basic Life Suppo
 rt\\) is the required CPR class for healthcare providers. Includes cardiac
  and respiratory arrest management\, CPR\, AED use\, and choking treatment
  for all ages. This class is appropriate for initial BLS or BLS renewal.\n
 \nVive CPR is an American Heart Association \\(AHA\\) Training Site. AHA "
 BLS Provider" certifications are issued on the same day.\n\nWe also offer 
 Blended Learning BLS certification courses \\(online course plus in-person
  Skills Session\\).\n\nLearn from a top-rated\, local CPR training company
  with over 1\,000 5-star reviews! Our classes are fun\, engaging\, and exp
 ertly taught by experienced first responders.\n\nLearn More & Enroll: http
 s://vivecpr.com/class/bls-certification/\n\nQuestions? Call/text \\(707\\)
  612-3277 or https://vivecpr.com/contact
LOCATION:Vive CPR
URL:https://vivecpr.com/class/bls-certification
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bottega Cellar Series with Casa Piena + Thomas Rivers Brown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T210000
UID:260918L6v_7vdVqkioWxrGhFpIiA
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Bottega on October 14 for an elegant evening featur
 ing Casa Piena\, hosted by Owner Carmen Policy and Rivers-Marie\, Aston Es
 tate and Platt Vineyards\, crafted by Winemaker Thomas Rivers Brown.\n\nRi
 vers-Marie and Aston Estate are two of Brown's own labels that produce ele
 gant\, site-driven Cabernet\, Pinot Noir and Chardonnays defined by restra
 int and shaped by his love of Burgundy. Casa Piena crafts standout Caberne
 t Sauvignon from its Yountville estate vineyard\, balancing Napa richness 
 with old-world Bordeaux elegance.\n\nGuests will experience a thoughtfully
  curated progression of wines\, paired with a seasonal multi-course menu b
 y Bottega Executive Chef Alex Espinoza. Each course is designed to complem
 ent the character and expression of the wines\, bringing together refined 
 flavors\, exceptional ingredients\, and the gracious hospitality that defi
 nes Bottega.\n\nPrice is inclusive of tax and gratuity.
LOCATION:Bottega Napa Valley
URL:https://www.opentable.com/booking/experiences-availability?rid=25489&r
 estref=25489&experienceId=791062&utm_source=external&utm_medium=referral&u
 tm_campaign=shared
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
