UID:260904Qb8ktr2bHkawRqHGNOnRBg
DESCRIPTION:The Petaluma Cinema Series is a unique educational forum that 
 invites community residents to join Santa Rosa Junior College students to 
 screen and discuss significant classic and modern cinema. Director Ari Gol
 d will participate in a 6pm onstage interview and answer questions followi
 ng the 7pm screening. Films are presented in 4K with 7.1 surround sound. 
 Visit the Petaluma Film Alliance website for complete program details.
LOCATION:Carole L. Elis Auditorium @ SRJC Petaluma
URL:https://petalumafilmalliance.org/2026-fall-schedule/
