 er 7\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 208\n\nCategory\n\nDrawing & Painting\, Extended 
 Classes\n\nExperience Level\n\nIntermediate\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\nReg
 istration Cost:\n\n$250\n\nYou have a basic understanding of how to use pa
