DESCRIPTION:ALL AGES!! \\* SIRSY is a ROCK & SOUL DUO with lots of pop sen
 sibility & just the right amount of sass! Fronted by charismatic lead sing
 er\, Melanie who is also the band's drummer and plays a full kit standing 
 up. Melanie plays bass parts on a keyboard with her drum stick and even th
 rows in some mean flute solos. Rich Libutti plays a road worn and well lov
 ed Rickenbacker through a pedal board full of vintage effects. He also pay
 s bass with his feet and tells super nerdy Star Wars jokes. SIRSY is known
  for passionate performances that often include lots of stories from the r
 oad\, laughs\, and dance parties. It's a good time! :\\) SIRSY plays 250\\
 + shows per year nationally & has played with Grace Potter\, Maroon 5\, Ch
 eap Trick\, Train\, and many more.  Their music is featured on Showtime’
