DESCRIPTION:Salsa social dancing in Novato\n\nDATE: October 17 @ 6:30 PM\n
 \nEVERY 1st and 3rd Saturday of the months\n\nTIME 6:30 PM\n\nWHERE: TOAST
 \, 5800 Nave Dr\, Novato\n\nIndoor dancing\, beautiful dance floor and A/C
 \n\n6:30 PM – 7:15 PM: Beginner Salsa Class \\(45 min\\)\n\n7:15 PM – 
 10:30 PM: Social Dancing \\(Salsa\, Bachata\, & Merengue\\)\n\nGet ready t
 o move! Join us for an evening of rhythm and community at our bi-monthly d
 ance social in Novato. Whether you’re a seasoned pro or have never stepp
 ed foot on a dance floor\, there’s a spot for you.\n\nWhen & Where\n\n
 • Date: Every 1st & 3rd Saturday\n\n• Time: 6:30 PM – 10:30 PM\n\n
 • Location: TOAST\, 5800 Nave Dr\, Novato\n\nThe Schedule\n\n• 6:30 PM
  – 7:15 PM: Beginner Salsa Class \\(45 min\\)\n\n• 7:15 PM – 10:30 P
 M: Social Dancing \\(Salsa\, Bachata\, & Merengue\\)\n\nOCTOBER 3 DJ ROMER
 O – CANCELED as restaurant has conflict\n\nOCTOBER 17 DJ ENCANNTO\n\nNOV
 EMBER 7 DJ ROMERO\n\nAdmission salsa social dancing in Novato\n\n• Presa
 le: $15\n\n• At the Door: $20\n\n• Tickets/Info: www.salsadancemarin.c
 om/events\n\n• Questions? Call 415-342-1649\n\nFood & Drink\n\n• Dinne
 r: Full menu available until 8:00 PM.\n\n• Drinks: All Night\n\nPro Tip:
  Arrive early to fuel up on some delicious food at TOAST before the social
  dancing kicks into high gear!
