 eginning at 4:00 PM.\n\nThroughout the day\, guests are invited to join gu
 ided tours of the property led by 4th-generation Nichelini family member P
 inky Dahn\, offering a unique look into the history\, stories\, and tradit
 ions that have shaped Nichelini Winery for more than a century.\n\nWe welc
