UID:260924ngBpCzSPB0K-qIuBTveD2g
DESCRIPTION:Join Alison Gass\, Founding Executive Director of the ICA San 
 Francisco\, and Phoebe Schenker\, Executive Director of Reuse Alliance\, f
 or a wide-ranging conversation about reuse in contemporary and historical 
 art and why it is more relevant than ever.\n\nThe discussion will explore 
 the many ways artists have engaged with reuse\, from incorporating found a
 nd reclaimed materials to making reuse itself a central subject of their w
 ork. Together\, Gass and Schenker will consider how reuse connects to broa
 der cultural conversations about creativity\, sustainability\, consumption
 \, and value\, while also exploring how reuse can become a creative practi
 ce in our own everyday lives.
