 onal produce and what’s available\, helping students learn to create hea
 lth-conscious yet tantalizing menus that embrace both flavor and wellness.
  Introducing our Fall/Winter Cooking Series—designed for both returning 
 and new students. This six-week program runs Mondays and Wednesdays\, each
  with a unique focus to offer variety\, skill-building\, and fun throughou
 t the season.Every Monday\, students will dive into healthy\, hearty meal 
 prep sessions. Each class focuses on creating nutritious\, satisfying dish
